---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Theravada Buddhist retreats</p>
      <h1>Make space for<br /><em>quiet reflection.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">Step away from the pace of daily life and spend time in a supportive setting shaped by the Theravada Buddhist tradition.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href={withBase('/retreats')}>Explore retreats <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/about')}>About the center</a></div>
      <div class="next-gathering"><span class="dot"></span><span><strong>Retreat program in planning</strong><br />Dates and formats are not confirmed</span><a href={withBase('/retreats')} aria-label="See retreat information">↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a quiet temple courtyard at dawn" role="img">
      <div class="sun"></div><div class="mountain mountain-back"></div><div class="mountain mountain-front"></div>
      <div class="temple"><div class="roof roof-top"></div><div class="roof roof-mid"></div><div class="temple-body"><div class="temple-door"></div></div><div class="temple-base"></div></div>
      <div class="reflection"></div><span class="art-caption">A quiet place to return</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="welcome section-wrap">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A welcoming community</p><h2>Take time to step away.</h2></div>
    <p>We are shaping a retreat program for people interested in spending a few days in a quiet, supportive Buddhist community. Everyone is welcome to learn more as plans develop.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="three-cards retreat-options section-wrap" aria-label="Retreat formats under consideration">
    <article class="feature-card"><span class="card-icon">◌</span><span class="card-kicker">Format under consideration</span><h3>Short retreat</h3><p>A retreat of around three days is one option being explored. Dates and details are not confirmed.</p><a class="card-arrow" href={withBase('/retreats')}>Retreat information&nbsp; →</a></article>
    <article class="feature-card"><span class="card-icon">❋</span><span class="card-kicker">Format under consideration</span><h3>Long retreat</h3><p>A retreat of around five days is also being considered. Dates and details are not confirmed.</p><a class="card-arrow" href={withBase('/retreats')}>Retreat information&nbsp; →</a></article>
  </section>

  <section class="quote-band"><p class="eyebrow">Retreat details in development</p><h2>Dates, arrangements, and program information will be shared here.</h2></section>

  <section class="support-strip section-wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Planning a retreat visit?</p><h2>Questions are welcome.</h2><p>Read the retreat FAQ or contact the center for general information.</p></div><a class="button button-outline" href={withBase('/faq')}>Read retreat FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</BaseLayout>
